  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PRO-VIA workshop om klimatanpassning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRO-VIA workshop on climate adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xf6;tet ska samla f&#xf6;rfattarna till PRO-VIA:s handbok, utvalda experter fr&#xe5;n utvecklade s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l som utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder samt representanter f&#xf6;r anv&#xe4;ndarna. Syftet &#xe4;r att presentera och diskutera de tre delarna i handboken, hur b&#xe4;st involvera anv&#xe4;ndarna och m&#xf6;ta deras behov och identifiera andra relevanta initiativ. M&#xf6;tet ska resultera i en konkret plan f&#xf6;r framtagandet och granskandet av handboken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The meeting will bring together authors PRO VIA&apos;s Handbook, selected experts from developed as well as developing countries, and  representatives of the users. The aim is to present and discuss the three parts of the manual, how best to involve users and their needs, and identify other relevant initiatives. The meeting should result in a concrete plan for development and by examining the manual.</narrative>
  </description>
